            {
                "entry_id": "8ecc6bd7-0030-3e03-9f4b-7f5e91e8ba17",
                "word": "artérite",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "359d6554-42bf-4b6b-aa31-5d3705a199c1",
                        "entry_id": "8ecc6bd7-0030-3e03-9f4b-7f5e91e8ba17",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "artérites"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ed761e5f-1835-30d6-973c-8ef3b2ec3228",
                        "entry_id": "8ecc6bd7-0030-3e03-9f4b-7f5e91e8ba17",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Inflammation d’une ou de plusieurs artères."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0ccbbfa-86f5-46dd-ac20-765a7789140e",
                                "sense_id": "ed761e5f-1835-30d6-973c-8ef3b2ec3228",
                                "text": "Ordinairement, dans ce degré, tout le système artériel est affecté. Le premier degré de l’artérite est celui qui se rencontre le plus souvent ; le deuxième est beaucoup moins fréquent; le troisième est plus rare encore."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "150c1a5f-456d-45a1-8dfa-321c28598b91",
                                "sense_id": "ed761e5f-1835-30d6-973c-8ef3b2ec3228",
                                "text": "L’artérite virale est une maladie propre aux équidés, causée par un virus du genre artérivirus, qui sévit de façons très diverses dans les différents effectifs de chevaux d’Europe et des autres continents."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc8cce5d-39df-490b-b3b9-169b2af426b4",
                                "sense_id": "ed761e5f-1835-30d6-973c-8ef3b2ec3228",
                                "text": "On estime que la cigarette est la cause principale de l’artérite, une maladie vasculaire qui touche 800.000 personnes en France. Sur les 7000 amputations réalisées chaque année, les artérites dues au tabac comptent pour plus de la moitié."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bab2f2da-3f54-444f-874f-0374c6fce5af",
                        "source_entry_id": "8ecc6bd7-0030-3e03-9f4b-7f5e91e8ba17",
                        "source_sense_id": "ed761e5f-1835-30d6-973c-8ef3b2ec3228",
                        "target_lang_word": "Arteriitis",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7bd89d1b-b7e9-4a7f-b89c-d413eec85855",
                        "source_entry_id": "8ecc6bd7-0030-3e03-9f4b-7f5e91e8ba17",
                        "source_sense_id": "ed761e5f-1835-30d6-973c-8ef3b2ec3228",
                        "target_lang_word": "arteritis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "arteritis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b474147-3fc9-31b6-97d6-96fcf137652d",
                                        "entry_id": "231790c1-f16d-3ef0-bee4-a639fcc5bdee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The inflammation of arterial walls, often due to infection or an autoimmune response."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2912d955-989a-462f-a50a-7b608f4d2209",
                                                "sense_id": "9b474147-3fc9-31b6-97d6-96fcf137652d",
                                                "text": "Arteritis has been noticed in variola, especially in the hemorrhagic form of it, sometimes as early as in the period of eruption, at other times later, and, apart from the aorta, the coronary arteries are usually attacked."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14e8a5bd-728a-4fdb-a261-05f3c4419f2c",
                                                "sense_id": "9b474147-3fc9-31b6-97d6-96fcf137652d",
                                                "text": "In July, 1819, M. Dalbant, of Grenoble, presented to the Faculty of Medicine, of Paris, a Thesis on Arteritis, containing five cases of inflammation of the arterial coats."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e02cdef4-6cfd-4107-8980-0be419aac795",
                                                "sense_id": "9b474147-3fc9-31b6-97d6-96fcf137652d",
                                                "text": "Bacterial endocarditis or injection of a foreign substance along with the drug cannot fully explain the radiographic and pathologic changes, since the arteritis has been documented after oral or intranasal amphetamine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
